# CHIPS-TI-06 v0 — the example crate carries a `[workspace]` stanza in
# Cargo.toml as a temporary measure so `cargo check --manifest-path .../Cargo.toml`
# works standalone before PM workspace-integration. That stanza causes
# cargo to write a per-crate Cargo.lock and target/ here; both will be
# absorbed by the parent workspace at integration time. Ignore both so
# the standalone-build artefacts don't enter version control.
/Cargo.lock
/target
